# BMP581 Driver

## Purpose

Driver for Bosch BMP581 pressure sensor.

## Responsibilities

- Sensor initialization
- Static pressure acquisition
- Temperature acquisition
- Sensor health monitoring

## Outputs

- Static Pressure (Pa)
- Temperature (°C)
- Sensor Status

## Planned APIs

```c
void BMP581_Init(void);

float BMP581_ReadPressure(void);

float BMP581_ReadTemperature(void);

uint8_t BMP581_GetStatus(void);
